all/4sp-submersible-pump14430358410.jpg\"/></span></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">4SP Submersible Pump</h1>\n<p>4SP submersible pump Our company is located in Daxi town, Wenling, Zhejiang province, where the traffic is really convenient. The main product of company is submersible pump, which includes 4SP submersible pump, multistage submersible pump, submersible screw pump, peripheral submersible pump and...</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"52196874\"/></p><p><strong>4SP submersible pump</strong><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241507316333464.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>Our company is located in Daxi town, Wenling, Zhejiang province, where the traffic is really convenient. The main product of company is submersible pump, which includes 4SP submersible pump, multistage submersible pump, submersible screw pump, peripheral submersible pump and so on. </p><p><strong>1. Product Description</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td valign=\"top\" width=\"102\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Brand Name</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"113\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Series</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"104\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Standard</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"135\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Capacity</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Head</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"102\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">JIADI</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"113\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">SP</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"104\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">NEMA Standard</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"135\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">0-2.7 m³/h</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">10-398</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"102\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Motor Power</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"113\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Phase</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"104\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Maximum Diameter</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"135\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Protection grade</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Length</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"102\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">0.37kw-4kw<br/></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"113\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Single phase/ Three phase</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"104\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">98mm</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"135\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">IP68</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">603-2143mm</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image009.jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241509408799587.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"/admin.seo.com.cn/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241507273114291.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\" title=\"image005(001).jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Copper Motor:<br/><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241511044990538.jpg\"/> <br/>·100% copper wire<br/>·Lower temperature and longer lifespan for the motor<br/>·Food grade oil keep the water clean</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Various Choices: <br/><img alt=\"image013(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241511156127771.jpg\"/> <br/>·Stainless steel / Copper / Iron available for outlet, suction chamber and oil chamber</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Impeller: </p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><img alt=\"image015(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241511269993482.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\">·High durable PPO impeller and diffuser (high flow model with S/S diffuser), sand resistant<br/>·Floating impeller design, avoid stuck</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Mechanical Seal:<br/><img alt=\"image017(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241511449078491.jpg\"/> <br/>·Super-high precision Carborundum Graphitemechanical seal<br/>·No oil-leakage,water and sand proof</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Control Box:     <br/><img alt=\"image019(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241511553256466.jpg\"/> <br/>·Keep pump constant water pressure without motor overheated or overloaded<br/>·Fire-resistant material casing</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Stator:<br/><img alt=\"image020(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241512055993815.jpg\"/> <br/>·100% cold-rolled Silicon steel (spec 800) with full pieces<br/>·Keep power durable<br/>·Continuous duty is guaranteed</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4. Product Application</strong></p><p>1.Pasture irrigation</p><p>2.Desertification control</p><p>3.Fountain</p><p>4.Domestic water</p><p>5.Agriculture irrigation</p><p>6.Desalination of sea water</p><p>7.Drinking water</p><p>8.Dripping irrigation</p><p><strong>5. MAIN FEATURES</strong></p><p>1) Max head ranges from 10 m to 398 m . </p><p>Max capacity ranges from 0.9 m3/h to 2.7 m3/h</p><p>2) 100% copper wire/ 304 stainless steel shaft/ Stainless steel impeller</p><p>3) Advanced and smart controller</p><p>4) 100% testing system for motor/complete set pump/controller, each pump will be tested good before delivery.</p><p>5) Installation is simple and convenient, free maintenance</p><p>6) The inch of the pump ranges from 2 inch to 6 inch</p><p><strong>6. Company profile</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image022(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241513237936580.jpg\"/></strong></p><p>Having been focusing on making pumps for more than 30 years, TAIZHOU JIADI PUMP INDUSTRY CO., LTD. becomes one of the most excellent companies in making pump. Our factory is seated Wenling, Zhejiang, China with 104 highway nearby, where the traffic is convenient for us to transport the goods. We sale many types of submersible pumps, including screw pump, multistage pump and so on. </p><p><strong>7. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>1. Q: What about our pump warranty?</strong></p><p>A: Usually 1 year pump warranty, and if the pump is broken, we could send you new pump parts to replace. </p><p><strong>2. 4.Q: Is it all right to make customer's own brand?</strong></p><p>A: It's ok to use our customer own Brand, all is according to our customers’ idea.</p><p><strong>3. Q: Do I need to install a pump?</strong></p><p>A: If you want to have good tap pressure, than a pump is required, if you only want to hand water the garden and there is enough head pressure in the tank then you may not need a pump, but in most cases a pump is the better option.</p><p><strong>4. Q: How can I contact with you?</strong></p><p>A: You can contact us by Emailing us or other methods like Wechat, Whatsapp and skype!</p><p><strong><br/></strong><br/></p><p><strong><br/></strong><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: 4SP submersible pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4sr-4-deep-well-su